21.. Approve and authorize execution of contract agreement with All City Management Services, Inc., (ACMS) for crossing guard services  -  Action: approved (Pass)

12.. Approve the Infrastructure Fund Annual Report for Fiscal Year 2016-17  -  Action: approved (Pass)

