16.. Adopt Resolution No. 2018-38 authorizing City staff to apply to the Orange County Transportation Authority (OCTA) for a Federal Transit Section 5310 Program Grant  -  Action: approved (Pass)

15.. Adopt Resolution No. 2018-35 concerning the status and update of the Pavement Management Plan (PMP) for the Measure M2 (M2) Program  -  Action: approved (Pass)

