{\*\generator Riched20 5.40.11.2210;}\viewkind4\uc1\pard\cf1\fs24 Mayor Pro Tem Peterson introduced the item and stated the goal is to enhance value for dollars spent when Council member(s) attend appropriately selected State and Federal advocacy meetings.\par
