Councilmember Semeta reported attending the Restaurant Roundtable Meeting, VIP Night at JimBoy's Tacos, and ACC-OC Board of Directors Planning Workshop.  Councilmember Semeta expressed her condolences to the family and friends of Zach Martinez.\par
